  "hints": [
    "The pad is in a side nook that only LAB-LIGHTS lights. The generator cannot run LAB-LIGHTS and LIFT-POWER together (40 and 50 is more than 60).",
    "You cannot end a turn in the dark, but your echo can. Light the nook to record a walk into it, then swap the power before you launch.",
    "Record right, right, up and wait. Walk back to the console and switch LAB-LIGHTS off and LIFT-POWER on, launch with {key:echo}, then go right twice, wait once and go right twice."
  ],
  "terminals": [
    {
      "position": [
        4,
        1
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Dark rooms are loud. My boots, my breath, the hum.",
        "My echo walks through them as if they were not there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "position": [
        1,
        8
      ],
      "lines": [
        "I sent the echo ahead into the dark.",
        "It always arrives. I am learning to trust it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "position": [
        8,
        11
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Day 9. Somewhere below, a pump started on its own.",
        "The building is remembering how to be alive."
      ]
    }
  ],
